{"id":"vod_sn_37513","vodId":"37513","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"恶魔之谜","name_cn":"恶魔之谜","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ef6dc7f94065ecc7fb02043ccc57695e.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在明星学园的十年黑组之中，那是一个由十二名顶尖暗杀者所组成的神秘班级，这一次，致使她们齐聚一堂的，是一位名叫一之濑晴（金元寿子 配音）的平凡女生，她是这十二个冷酷杀手共同的目标。尽管身为众矢之的，但晴依旧信心满满，她的理想只有一个，那就是活到毕业的那一天。　　东兔角（诹访彩花 配音）是十二名杀手之一，也是资历最老的前辈之一，然而，冷若冰霜的她却被晴的乐观和开朗渐渐吸引，杀心转变成为了爱心，最终，东兔角反而成为了晴的保护着。面对这曾经是同伴的另外十一人，东兔角能否保护晴免遭杀身之祸呢？又是谁要如此大动干戈夺取晴的性命呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:07","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/29780TyWsG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P8eMMmXFYB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qcKcpJ4piY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wLKT8VGU8E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ux4Uirp40A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5iG4xM48iX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4qKkuutust1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y9D3RSkzXk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ssU1p00C4T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uknXSWnR921/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LR0rexGBnW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iHhtYz09hx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gVi1Tcgg2L1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:10.042Z"}